VISUALIZATION SPECIFICATIONS:
Chart type: Grouped/Clustered Bar Chart, 5 vertical bars per configuration.
Figure size: (30, 10) inches. White background throughout.

Y-AXES (5 total, color-coded):
  Left primary         : Token Generation (t/s)    color=#1565c0  max=auto   (column tg_tps)
  Left offset (ax2)    : Prompt Processing (t/s)   color=#5dade2  max=auto   (column pp_tps)
  Left offset-2 (ax3)  : Total Duration (s)        color=#e74c3c  max=auto   (column duration_s)
  Right primary        : Peak VRAM (MiB)           color=#81c784  max=auto   (column vram_peak_mib)
  Right offset (ax5)   : Shared VRAM (MiB)         color=#2e7d32  max=auto   (column server_shared_mib)
  ax2 spine: ('axes', -0.06)  ax3 spine: ('axes', -0.13)  ax4 spine: ('axes', 1.06) ticks/label on right. ax5 spine: ('axes', 1.13) ticks/label on right.

BAR LAYOUT:
  5 bars per group, bar_width=0.16, offsets=[-2, -1, 0, +1, +2] * bar_width.
  Bar order (left to right): Duration | PP | TG | Peak VRAM | Shared VRAM
  Colors: Duration=#e74c3c  PP=#5dade2  TG=#1565c0  VRAM=#81c784  SharedRAM=#2e7d32. Alpha=0.85.

DATA LABELS:
  Rotated 90deg, fontsize=7.0, above each bar (y = value + 0.8% of axis max).
  Format: Duration->mm:ss  PP->1 decimal  TG->1 decimal  VRAM->integer+'M'  SharedRAM->integer+'M'
  Label color matches bar color.

X-AXIS LABELS: the TEST CONFIGURATION IDs below (full names). Rotation=35, ha='right', fontsize=8.0.

BACKGROUND REGION BANDS: one band per model (Config Set A, B, C), background #fff3e0 / #ffe0b2 / #ffcc80,
bold region label at the top of each band, dashed vertical dividers between regions.

LEGEND: upper center, above the chart, ncol=8: Duration, PP, TG, VRAM, SharedRAM + one patch per region.
TITLE: '{{ title }}'  fontsize=13, fontweight='bold'.
GRID: Horizontal only, color='#cccccc', linewidth=0.5, alpha=0.6.
OUTPUT: PNG, dpi=180, bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white'.
